=================================
Advanced Resource Connector (ARC)
=================================


Release Notes for NorduGrid ARC  7.1.2     18.05.2026
=======================================================

This is a bugfix release addressing only a single bug causing migration problems from ARC 6.

The problem was due to wrong permissions set to the new "jobs" directory that is created in the controldir in ARC 7.

How to fix
------------

The easiest is just to manually set the correct permissions on the controldir:
chmod -R 0755 <controldir>/jobs

Or, if you want to do it the "proper" way with the new release (shown for rhel):

1. arcctl service stop -a
2. dnf update "nordugrid*"
3. rm <controldir>/version2
4. arcctl service restart -a



The following Bugzilla tickets have been adressed or solved
------------------------------------------------------------
* 4297  Wrong permission of controldir/jobs after upgrade from ARC 6 to ARC 7


